<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>out of love!</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">22december</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">out of love!</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5u0rJIznoxXOXull8cVUFv</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.170" end="00:05.490">빛을 잃긴 싫어</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.490" end="00:09.280">Hehehe, Shenron, what the fuck?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.280" end="00:10.920">Got me sayin' like, "What's up, lil' bitch?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.920" end="00:12.620">Do you really want love? No lies and shit"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.620" end="00:15.280">'Cause lately I've been thinkin' you just hit my line to fuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.280" end="00:17.180">Damn, I really thought I found my other half, no luck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.180" end="00:18.680">Think I'm runnin' out of love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.400" end="00:19.900">Late night, are you dreamin' of me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.800" end="00:21.860">I don't wanna lose you, baby, please don't leave</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.860" end="00:23.630">'Cause I've been stackin' all these bands for a minute</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.630" end="00:25.130">Yeah, I've been countin' these digits</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.660" end="00:26.420">And we can skrrt off in the whip, we goin' fast with no limit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.420" end="00:27.920">Got me sayin' like, "What's up, lil' bitch?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.850" end="00:30.350">Do you really want love? No lies and shit"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.350" end="00:32.480">'Cause lately I've been thinking you just hit my line to fuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.480" end="00:34.670">Damn, I really thought I found my other half, no luck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.670" end="00:36.170">Think I'm runnin' out of love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.870" end="00:37.370">Late night, are you dreamin' of me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.280" end="00:39.160">I don't wanna lose you, baby, please don't leave</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.160" end="00:41.020">'Cause I've been stackin' all these bands for a minute</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.020" end="00:42.520">Yeah, I've been countin' these digits</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.110" end="00:44.050">And we can skrrt off in the whip, we goin' fast with no limit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.050" end="00:45.940">I've been runnin' out of love, but damn, I get that shit back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.940" end="00:47.880">These bitches wanna fuck with me because I'm gettin' the racks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.880" end="00:50.250">She said she wanna go and smoke, but can we smoke enough gas?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.250" end="00:52.590">She said she sorry for that shit, I'll leave it all in the past</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.590" end="00:54.090">I just down another bottle</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.520" end="00:55.080">Now you know I'm gettin' sick of this sippin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.080" end="00:57.030">And I've been ballin' so hard, bitch, I feel like I'm Pippen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.030" end="00:59.080">I make a three-point swish 'cause you know I ain't missin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.080" end="01:01.050">I want love, not lust, 'cause she seein' the vision</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.050" end="01:03.830">I want love, not lust, I just need yo' trust</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.830" end="01:05.970">Now yo' ex a fuckin' lame, that's why I keep the heater tucked</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.970" end="01:08.070">All these racks comin' in got me sayin', "What the fuck?"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.070" end="01:10.550">Like, spend yo' rent just to have a little fun night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.550" end="01:12.260">Baby, come through, let me hit it, kung fu</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.260" end="01:14.570">I just want one bitch, and that bitch is you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.570" end="01:16.250">I can give you my heart, just don't break it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.250" end="01:18.570">Got a fat ass, so I tell that bitch, "Shake it"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.570" end="01:20.070">Got me sayin' like, "What's up, lil' bitch?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.030" end="01:22.190">Do you really want love? No lies and shit"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.190" end="01:24.330">'Cause lately I've been thinking you just hit my line to fuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.330" end="01:26.450">Damn, I really thought I found my other half, no luck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.450" end="01:27.950">Think I'm runnin' out of love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.740" end="01:29.240">Late night, are you dreamin' of me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.980" end="01:31.130">I don't wanna lose you, baby, please don't leave</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.130" end="01:32.720">'Cause I've been stackin' all these bands for a minute</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.720" end="01:34.220">Yeah, I've been countin' these digits</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.140" end="01:35.700">And we can skrrt off in the whip, we goin' fast with no limit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.700" end="01:37.380">Got me sayin' like, "What's up, lil' bitch?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.380" end="01:39.570">Do you really want love? No lies and shit"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.570" end="01:41.720">'Cause lately I've been thinking you just hit my line to fuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.720" end="01:43.730">Damn, I really thought I found my other half, no luck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.730" end="01:45.230">Think I'm runnin' out of love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.920" end="01:46.420">Late night, are you dreamin' of me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.410" end="01:48.590">I don't wanna lose you, baby, please don't leave</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.590" end="01:50.110">'Cause I've been stackin' all these bands for a minute</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.110" end="01:51.610">Yeah, I've been countin' these digits</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.230" end="01:54.070">And we can skrrt off in the whip, we goin' fast with no limit on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.070" end="01:58.070" /></div></body></tt>